{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"855848334307360829","content":"```Counterfeit Curfew Pass:\nThis allows one person to be out past curfew.  The price you pay for a pass determines the DC of the investigation check if a guard were to examine the pass.  A one week pass costs 5 times that of a night pass, and a permanent pass costs 3 times as much as a week.  Passes are not upgradable once purchased, so if you want a better pass, you'll have to buy a fresh one.  Also Passes are non transferable as they have your picture on them.  The prices and DC's are as follows: (If you purchase a pass make sure to note how long its valid and the total cost here)\n5gp - DC10\n15gp - DC15\n50gp - DC20\n200GP - DC25```","created_at":"2021-06-19T16:48:31.835000Z","edited_at":"2021-07-21T14:01:38.546000Z","id":"855851555714891816","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
